---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How RANT handles privacy, hosting metadata, and external services."
>
  <section class="section privacy-page" style="padding-top: 8rem; min-height: calc(100vh - 300px);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <span class="section-label">Privacy</span>
      <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        RANT (Rack And Networking Tool) is a lightweight source of truth for physical network infrastructure. The RANT website is built to share information about the project while collecting as little data as possible.
      </p>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">Effective date: 4 September 2026</p>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.5rem;">
        <section>
          <h2>What this site collects</h2>
          <p>
            This site does not include contact forms, advertising pixels, remarketing scripts, or behavioural tracking. It does not intentionally collect personal information from visitors.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
          <p>
            This site uses <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to understand traffic patterns. Cloudflare Web Analytics is cookieless and does not use fingerprinting or cross-site tracking. It collects only aggregate, anonymised data such as page views, referring URLs, and general geographic region. No personal data is stored by this application as a result of analytics.
          </p>
          <p>
            For more detail on how Cloudflare handles analytics data, see the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Hosting metadata</h2>
          <p>
            The site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process standard request metadata, such as IP address, user agent, timestamps, and requested URLs, to deliver the site securely and prevent abuse.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>External services and links</h2>
          <p>
            The site links to external websites, including GitHub and a separate Live Demo environment. External services have their own privacy practices and may receive normal browser request metadata when you visit them.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For privacy questions or site concerns, contact the project owner through the <a href="https://github.com/fluffycheese" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FluffyCheese GitHub profile</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
